Vespera

The playful button interactions in index.html (hold to confirm, slide to confirm,
confetti and ash bursts, cooldown, shine, glitch, the evil eyes and the troll button)
were inspired by Evil Buttons by radiumcoders (https://github.com/radiumcoders/evil-buttons),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Vespera's versions are written from scratch in plain
JavaScript and CSS; no code from that project is included.
